-- Experiment 186 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, Appendix D Problem 11 (FriCAS column).
-- The shooting statement (six_masses.m) needs a numeric ODE solver inside a
-- two-variable root finder.  FriCAS has fixed/adaptive RK4 integrators
-- (NumericalOrdinaryDifferentialEquations) but no numeric root finder for a
-- non-polynomial system, so both rows are SKIP rather than a hand-written
-- Newton iteration.
)read ../siam100_common.input )quiet
vskip("d11.machine", "FindRoot over NDSolve")
vskip("d11.wp50", "FindRoot over NDSolve")
)quit
